{"title":"OMM Final Exam","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>OMM Final Exam</b> (also known as Examen Final) is the last of three tests of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mexican_Mathematics_Olympiad\" title=\"Mexican Mathematics Olympiad\">Mexican Mathematics Olympiad</a> at state level in Mexico.  Participants take the test by scoring high in the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OMM_Semifinal_Exam\" title=\"OMM Semifinal Exam\">OMM Semifinal Exam</a>.  Top scorers move on to take the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mexico_National_Olympiad\" title=\"Mexico National Olympiad\">Mexico National Olympiad</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Structure\">Structure</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OMM_Final_Exam&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Structure\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The test has 8 questions that must be solved in two sessions of 4.5 hours.  Like the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OMM_Semifinal_Exam\" title=\"OMM Semifinal Exam\">OMM Semifinal Exam</a>, complete solutions are required.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Past_Tests\">Past Tests</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OMM_Final_Exam&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Past Tests\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note: All of the problems and solutions are in Spanish.\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Problems</th>\n<th>Solutions\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/final16.pdf\">2016 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/solfinal16.pdf\">2016 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/final15.pdf\">2015 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/solfinal15.pdf\">2015 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/final14.pdf\">2014 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/solfinal14.pdf\">2014 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/final13.pdf\">2013 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/solfinal13.pdf\">2013 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/final12.pdf\">2012 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/solfinal12.pdf\">2012 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/final11.pdf\">2011 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/solfinal11.pdf\">2011 Test Solutions</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/finales/final10.pdf\">2010 Test</a>\n</td>\n<td><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ommenlinea.org/wp-content/uploads/practica/fi